le for this change\n\nThe compatibility converter continued searching aliases after finding an exact field match. A Parquet column could therefore be materialized into a different Avro field whose alias had the same name.\n\n### What changes are included in this PR?\n\nReturn an exact Avro field match before checking aliases in `AvroIndexedRecordConverter`. Add coverage for exact-name precedence and alias fallback.\n\n### Are these changes tested?\n\n- `mvn -pl parquet-avro test`\n- `mvn spotless:check`\n\n### Are there any user-facing changes?\n\nFixes incorrect field mapping when a reader schema contains an exact field name and another field with that name as an alias.\n\nCloses #3792","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-26T23:30:10Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T02:43:32Z","closed_at":"2026-09-30T02:43:09Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"607ccd432cd99d0ab673b7a5ffbc95b85ae9fb45","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"zhangxinyao88:codex/issue-3792-avro-alias-priority","ref":"codex/issue-3792-avro-alias-priority","repo":{"id":1389737131,"node_id":"R_kgDOUtW0qw","name":"parquet-java","full_name":"zhangxinyao88/parquet-java","owner":{"login":"zhangxinyao88","id":43081360,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMDgxMzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43081360?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangxinyao88","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangxinyao88","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangxinyao88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangxinyao88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangxinyao88/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangxinyao88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangxinyao88/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangxinyao88/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/us